<div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div class="summber-note-panel" style="display: block;"><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 微軟正黑體; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 微軟正黑體; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">冰箱公升數不同含有不同配件</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 微軟正黑體; font-size: 18px;"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 微軟正黑體; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 7H.11H.17H.22H.27H.33H 內含背帶</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 微軟正黑體; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 27H.33H.48H.76H有滾輪設計可拖行,使用更方便</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 微軟正黑體; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 48H.76H有額外小蓋,取物更方便</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 微軟正黑體; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 以下為各冰箱尺寸自重</span></p></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div class=""><a href="#" class="upload-image ui-draggable"><img src="/uploads/images/982ca3af686e6dedc190c5e38a8f7a3c.jpg" class="img-responsive" height="" width="100%" alt=""></a></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div></div></div></div>